==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|щади́ть}}

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|ru|skęd}}
Inherited from {{inh|ru|orv|щадѣти|gloss=to keep, spare}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*ščęditi}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*skęd-}}, ablaut to {{m|ine-pro|*skǫd-}} (from which descends {{m|ru|скудный}}).

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|щади́ть|impf|pf=пощади́ть}}

# to [[spare]], to have [[mercy]] (on)
#: {{ux|ru|'''щади́ть''' чьи́-ли́бо чу́вства|to spare smb.'s feelings|inline=y}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|4b+p|щад}}

